WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.200
okay so today I want to show you how I stopped
reading my inbox by hand

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:09.800
the whole thing is one rule file with three queues
reply today read this week and archive

00:00:09.800 --> 00:00:15.100
the part people get wrong is they let it send
on day one do not do that keep send false

00:00:15.100 --> 00:00:21.400
I read about fifty drafts before I trusted it
and two of them were wrong in a way I would
not have caught from the summary

00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:27.900
so step one install the client point it at your
provider and run doctor to check the token

00:00:27.900 --> 00:00:34.300
step two write the rule file the match list is
just strings from client subject urgent and so on

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:40.000
step three run it as a daemon and read the digest
at six it tells you what got archived so nothing
disappears silently

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:45.500
on my inbox that was forty one emails on day one
six needed a reply the rest were noise

00:00:45.500 --> 00:00:49.000
that is the whole setup I will put the rule file
and the docs links below
